absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 animate-bounce\"><svg class=\"w-8 h-8 text-amber-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3\"></path></svg></div></section><section class=\"py-20 px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16 animate-fade-in-up\"><p class=\"text-amber-600 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4\">Remarkable Experiences</p><h2 class=\"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">Journeys That Transform</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Each story below represents years of curation, expert relationships, and an unwavering commitment to excellence.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"group animate-fade-in-up transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-2xl\" style=\"animation-delay:0ms\"><div class=\"relative h-64 rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-6 shadow-lg\"><img alt=\"The Art of Wandering\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/hero-maldives.jpg\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-black/40 transition-colors duration-300\"></div></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-amber-600 transition-colors\">The Art of Wandering</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Discover how intentional travel shapes the soul. From the galleries of Florence to the temples of Kyoto, we craft journeys where every moment becomes a memory.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Europe &amp; Asia</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path></svg>14 days</span></div><p class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold text-lg\">$16,500</p><button class=\"w-full bg-gray-900 text-white py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all duration-300 font-semibold hover:shadow-lg hover:translate-y-[-2px]\">Inquire About This Journey</button></div></div><div class=\"group animate-fade-in-up transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-2xl\" style=\"animation-delay:100ms\"><div class=\"relative h-64 rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-6 shadow-lg\"><img alt=\"Wilderness Awakening\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/kenya-safari.jpg\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-black/40 transition-colors duration-300\"></div></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-amber-600 transition-colors\">Wilderness Awakening</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">True adventure demands more than courage—it demands presence. Immerse yourself in Africa&#x27;s most pristine ecosystems and emerge transformed.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Kenya &amp; Tanzania</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path></svg>10 days</span></div><p class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold text-lg\">$14,200</p><button class=\"w-full bg-gray-900 text-white py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all duration-300 font-semibold hover:shadow-lg hover:translate-y-[-2px]\">Inquire About This Journey</button></div></div><div class=\"group animate-fade-in-up transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-2xl\" style=\"animation-delay:200ms\"><div class=\"relative h-64 rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-6 shadow-lg\"><img alt=\"Alpine Tranquility\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/swiss-alps.jpg\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-black/40 transition-colors duration-300\"></div></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-amber-600 transition-colors\">Alpine Tranquility</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Where mountains touch the sky, the soul finds peace. Experience luxury intertwined with nature&#x27;s grandeur in the heart of the Alps.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Switzerland</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path></svg>8 days</span></div><p class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold text-lg\">$13,800</p><button class=\"w-full bg-gray-900 text-white py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all duration-300 font-semibold hover:shadow-lg hover:translate-y-[-2px]\">Inquire About This Journey</button></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 px-6 bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-50 to-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16 animate-fade-in-up\"><p class=\"text-amber-600 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4\">Curated Services</p><h2 class=\"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900\">The Art of Luxury Travel</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><a class=\"group p-8 rounded-xl border-2 border-gray-200 hover:border-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-50 transition-all duration-300 animate-fade-in-up hover:shadow-lg cursor-pointer\" style=\"animation-delay:0ms\" href=\"/experiences\"><div class=\"mb-4 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform duration-300 text-amber-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-ship w-8 h-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 10.189V14\"></path><path d=\"M12 2v3\"></path><path d=\"M19 13V7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6\"></path><path d=\"M19.38 20A11.6 11.6 0 0 0 21 14l-8.188-3.639a2 2 0 0 0-1.624 0L3 14a11.6 11.6 0 0 0 2.81 7.76\"></path><path d=\"M2 21c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1s1.2 1 2.5 1c2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">Yacht Charters</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">Private Mediterranean voyages</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-600 font-bold group-hover:gap-3 transition-all\"><span>45+<!-- --> Experiences</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\"group p-8 rounded-xl border-2 border-gray-200 hover:border-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-50 transition-all duration-300 animate-fade-in-up hover:shadow-lg cursor-pointer\" style=\"animation-delay:50ms\" href=\"/experiences\"><div class=\"mb-4 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform duration-300 text-amber-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-binoculars w-8 h-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 10h4\"></path><path d=\"M19 7V4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-2a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M20 21a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-3.851c0-1.39-2-2.962-2-4.829V8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v11a2 2 0 0 0 2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M 22 16 L 2 16\"></path><path d=\"M4 21a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3.851c0-1.39 2-2.962 2-4.829V8a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h4a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M9 7V4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H6a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v3\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">Safari Expeditions</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">Guided wildlife encounters</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-600 font-bold group-hover:gap-3 transition-all\"><span>32+<!-- --> Experiences</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\"group p-8 rounded-xl border-2 border-gray-200 hover:border-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-50 transition-all duration-300 animate-fade-in-up hover:shadow-lg cursor-pointer\" style=\"animation-delay:100ms\" href=\"/experiences\"><div class=\"mb-4 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform duration-300 text-amber-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-landmark w-8 h-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 18v-7\"></path><path d=\"M11.12 2.198a2 2 0 0 1 1.76.006l7.866 3.847c.476.233.31.949-.22.949H3.474c-.53 0-.695-.716-.22-.949z\"></path><path d=\"M14 18v-7\"></path><path d=\"M18 18v-7\"></path><path d=\"M3 22h18\"></path><path d=\"M6 18v-7\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">Cultural Immersion</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">Heritage &amp; traditions</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-600 font-bold group-hover:gap-3 transition-all\"><span>67+<!-- --> Experiences</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\"group p-8 rounded-xl border-2 border-gray-200 hover:border-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-50 transition-all duration-300 animate-fade-in-up hover:shadow-lg cursor-pointer\" style=\"animation-delay:150ms\" href=\"/experiences\"><div class=\"mb-4 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform duration-300 text-amber-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mountain w-8 h-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m8 3 4 8 5-5 5 15H2L8 3z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">Mountain Retreats</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">Alpine luxury escapes</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-600 font-bold group-hover:gap-3 transition-all\"><span>28+<!-- --> Experiences</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\"group p-8 rounded-xl border-2 border-gray-200 hover:border-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-50 transition-all duration-300 animate-fade-in-up hover:shadow-lg cursor-pointer\" style=\"animation-delay:200ms\" href=\"/experiences\"><div class=\"mb-4 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform duration-300 text-amber-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wine w-8 h-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 22h8\"></path><path d=\"M7 10h10\"></path><path d=\"M12 15v7\"></path><path d=\"M12 15a5 5 0 0 0 5-5c0-2-.5-4-2-8H9c-1.5 4-2 6-2 8a5 5 0 0 0 5 5Z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">Culinary Tours</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">Gastronomic journeys</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-600 font-bold group-hover:gap-3 transition-all\"><span>41+<!-- --> Experiences</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\"group p-8 rounded-xl border-2 border-gray-200 hover:border-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-50 transition-all duration-300 animate-fade-in-up hover:shadow-lg cursor-pointer\" style=\"animation-delay:250ms\" href=\"/experiences\"><div class=\"mb-4 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform duration-300 text-amber-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart w-8 h-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">Wellness Sanctuaries</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">Spa &amp; rejuvenation</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-600 font-bold group-hover:gap-3 transition-all\"><span>36+<!-- --> Experiences</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center animate-fade-in-up\"><p class=\"text-amber-600 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-6\">Our Approach</p><h2 class=\"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8\">We Don&#x27;t Sell Vacations.<span class=\"text-amber-600\"> We Craft Transformations.</span></h2><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8\">Travel, for us, has always been about more than logistics. It&#x27;s about understanding who you are, what moves you, and where your curiosity leads. We believe that the best journeys aren&#x27;t pre-packaged—they&#x27;re deeply personal.</p><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Each journey begins with a conversation. Through careful listening and decades of insider knowledge, we connect you with destinations and experiences that resonate with your soul. The result? Travel that doesn&#x27;t just show you the world—it changes how you see it.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 px-6 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-gray-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16 animate-fade-in-up\"><p class=\"text-amber-600 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4\">World-Class Feedback</p><h2 class=\"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900\">Voices of Distinction</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 border border-gray-100 animate-fade-in-up hover:border-amber-200\" style=\"animation-delay:0ms\"><div class=\"flex gap-1 mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star fill-amber-500 text-amber-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star fill-amber-500 text-amber-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.12